{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Fructose</strong> isn\u2019t your average arena shooter \u2014 these are giant, semi-open battlefields, <strong>procedurally generated</strong> to keep every run fresh. Dash, jump, wall-run, and unleash your arsenal across layered, sprawling environments built for full movement freedom, exploration, and chaos.<br>Choose from various ninjas such as a Fox, Elephant, Wolverine, and Monkey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/extras/wolverine.png?t=1744123320\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<strong><i><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></i></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/extras/15Seconds_gif.gif?t=1744123320\" />\u00a0 \u00a0<strong><i><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Imagine Fruit Ninja \u2014 but you\u2019re a superpowered ninja wielding 12 weapons, bending time, and turning hordes of mutant fruit into pulp.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Arenas</strong>: Fight in sprawling, semi-open battlefields that are procedurally generated for fresh challenges every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Arsenal</strong>: Equip powerful swords and unique weapons purchased between waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rapid-Fire Action</strong>: Thrilling, high-intensity battles in under 30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Loadouts</strong>: Choose from AK-47s, wands, bear cannons, and more \u2014 plus your main melee weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Waves</strong>: Survive relentless waves of monstrous mutant fruit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Enemies</strong>: From a Banana Snake to a Dragonfruit Dragon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>War Loot</strong>: Gather coins to buy gear, upgrades, and weapons from the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power Ups</strong>: Collect seeds and unlock permanent upgrades to grow stronger with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Culinary Combat</strong>: Slice fruit in the right recipe combos to earn bonus coins and XP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine Fruit Ninja \u2014 but you\u2019re a superpowered ninja wielding 12 weapons, bending time, and turning hordes of mutant fruit into pulp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2506550?t=1744123320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744123320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/816f77ab2153974000e8d3d9ac4f91606be35024/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744123320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506550/816f77ab2153974000e8d3d9ac4f91606be35024/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744123320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Fructose</strong> isn\u2019t your average arena shooter \u2014 these are giant, semi-open battlefields, <strong>procedurally generated</strong> to keep every run fresh. Dash, jump, wall-run, and unleash your arsenal across layered, sprawling environments built for full movement freedom, exploration, and chaos.<br>Choose from various ninjas such as a Fox, Elephant,